    },
    "If no prompt appears, you can change location access in Settings. You can also keep using reminders while Offshore is open." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the user's location access.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا لم تظهر مطالبة، يمكنك تغيير إذن الوصول إلى الموقع في الإعدادات. يمكنك أيضًا مواصلة استخدام التذكيرات عندما يكون Offshore مفتوحًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn keine Abfrage erscheint, können Sie den Standortzugriff in den Einstellungen ändern. Sie können Erinnerungen auch weiterhin bei geöffneter App nutzen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si no aparece la solicitud, puedes cambiar el acceso a la ubicación en Ajustes. También puedes seguir usando los recordatorios con Offshore abierta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si aucune demande ne s’affiche, vous pouvez modifier l’accès à votre position dans Réglages. Vous pouvez aussi continuer à utiliser les rappels quand Offshore est ouverte."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se a solicitação não aparecer, você pode alterar o acesso à localização nos Ajustes. Também pode continuar usando lembretes com o Offshore aberto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果没有出现提示，可以在“设置”中更改定位权限。你也可以继续在 Offshore 打开时使用提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Offshore is turned off, enable it in %@." : {
      "comment" : "A footnote below the \"Upgrade in App Settings\" button, providing instructions on how to enable location services if Offshore is turned off.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اذا كان Offshore متوقفا، فقم بتمكينه في %@."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Offshore deaktiviert ist, aktivieren Sie es in %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si Offshore esta desactivado, activalo en %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si Offshore est desactive, activez-le dans %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se o Offshore estiver desativado, ative-o em %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果 Offshore 已关闭，请在 %@ 中启用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If presets stay linked to this budget, they may apply again when you re-link this card." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا ظلت الإعدادات المسبقة مرتبطة بهذه الميزانية، فقد يتم تطبيقها مرة أخرى عند إعادة ربط هذه البطاقة."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Voreinstellungen mit diesem Budget verknüpft bleiben, gelten sie möglicherweise erneut, wenn Sie diese Karte erneut verknüpfen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si los plantillas siguen vinculados a este presupuesto, pueden aplicarse de nuevo al volver a vincular esta cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si les préréglages restent liés à ce budget, ils pourront s’appliquer de nouveau lorsque vous relierez cette carte."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se as predefinições permanecerem vinculadas a esse orçamento, elas poderão ser aplicadas novamente quando você vincular novamente este cartão."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果预设与此预算保持关联，则当您重新关联此卡时，它们可能会再次应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you want to review Photos access, open %@." : {
      "comment" : "A footnote below the Photos permission row that instructs the user on how to review Photos access settings on a Mac.",
